  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A small stone is attached to a rope and rotated in a horizontal circle at angular velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span>. Then the angular velocity of the stone is increased at a rate of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.50\\; \\textup{rad\\,s}^{-2}\"></span> for <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\"></span> seconds. During this time, the stone completes eight full revolutions. </p>\n<p>What is the best estimate for <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\\; \\textup{rad\\,s}^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\\; \\textup{rad\\,s}^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12\\; \\textup{rad\\,s}^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"16\\; \\textup{rad\\,s}^{-1}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
